<Base title="Ivan’s Prod" description="Real tests. Honest verdicts. AI tools for solo business owners, tested by Ivan.">
  <h1>Real tests.<br>Honest verdicts.</h1>
  <p class="lead">I’m Ivan. After 35 years fixing problems for people in their homes, I test AI tools so you can spend your time on the work you love. Some help you find clients, some save you hours, some handle the jobs you dislike. I try each one myself and give you my personal opinion on whether it would be good for you.</p>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/reviews/">Browse reviews by problem</a></p>
  <h2>How every review works</h2>
  <p>I use the tool on a real project. I tell you what worked, what went wrong, and how to make it fit the way you work. Then I give you a verdict. Here’s an example:</p>
  <div class="verdict">
    <div><h3>This is for you if…</h3><ul><li>you work alone and want a simple way to reach new clients</li><li>you’re ready to follow up on the replies</li></ul></div>
    <div class="not"><h3>This is not for you if…</h3><ul><li>you want results with no setup</li><li>you can’t spare an hour a week</li></ul></div>
  </div>
  <section class="callout">
    <h2>New to AI? You’re in the right place.</h2>
    <p>You don’t need to be technical. I explain things the way I did for 35 years with my clients: the why first, in plain words, so you don’t fall into the same traps twice.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>AI is a tool, not a replacement.</strong> Its job is to take the tasks you don’t enjoy so you can focus on the work you do best.</li>
      <li><strong>You stay in charge.</strong> I show you how to check what a tool does before it goes anywhere near your clients.</li>
      <li><strong>Mistakes are normal.</strong> I share mine, like the reply settings I got wrong when I tested Expree.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a href="/reviews/">See how I review a tool</a></p>
  </section>
  <p class="note">Some links on this site are affiliate links. <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Here’s how that works.</a></p>
</Base>
